          "check_in": "14:00",
          "check_out": "12:00",
          "notes_base": "Gaode Maps rating 4.7 stars. A floral art and lifestyle aesthetics designer hotel perfectly suited for the INFJ romantic aesthetic — the entire property is designed around flower-inspired artistry and cozy literary atmosphere. Located on Shulin Street right next to the historic Jinma Bijifang arch and Nanping Walking Street in central Kunming. Extremely convenient: 15 min from Dounan Flower Market (斗南花卉市场) by taxi, walkable to Green Lake (翠湖) within 15 min, and steps from Kunming's best evening street food and cafes. Perfect for 1-night stop with city-center vibes. Est. 400-600 CNY/night.",
          "notes_local": "高德地图评分4.7星。以花艺为主题的生活美学设计师精品酒店，整体设计充满花卉灵感和文艺温馨气息，非常适合INFJ情侣的审美。位于书林街，紧邻昆明地标金马碧鸡坊和南屏步行街，地处市中心。打车15分钟可达斗南花卉市场，步行15分钟可达翠湖公园，楼下即是昆明最好逛的美食街和咖啡馆。中转昆明一晚的最佳选择。预估400-600元/晚。",
          "optional": false,
