          "stars": 4.9,
          "check_in": "15:00",
          "check_out": "12:00",
          "notes_base": "Gaode Maps rating: 4.9 stars. THE dream pastoral luxury resort in Lijiang — the Banyan Tree (悦榕庄) is an internationally acclaimed 5-star resort set in an expansive estate near Shuhe Ancient Town. Far from the busy old town crowds, the resort sits amidst countryside gardens, with rice paddy field views and distant Jade Dragon Snow Mountain panoramas. Multiple pools, a full Banyan Tree Spa, two on-site restaurants, and meandering garden paths make this a perfect 可以待一天 (spend-the-whole-day) sanctuary. The resort's Naxi-influenced architecture with private villa-style rooms, courtyards, and cozy reading corners is ideal for an INFJ couple. Arrive by high-speed rail from Kunming (approx 3h). Est. 1500-2200 CNY/night. Total 3 nights est. 5400-6600 CNY.",
          "notes_local": "高德地图评分4.9星。丽江最梦幻的高端田园度假胜地——悦榕庄是国际知名五星度假村，隐于束河古镇郊野，远离古城喧嚣。大片园林花园、稻田景观、玉龙雪山远景尽收眼底。室外泳池、悦榕庄Spa、两家酒店餐厅、迂回花园步道，是真正可以待一天的世外桃源。纳西风格别墅式客房、私家庭院、温馨阅读角，专为INFJ情侣打造。从昆明乘高铁约3小时抵达。预估1500-2200元/晚，3晚合计约5400-6600元。",
          "optional": false,
