          "notes_base": "Last night in Lijiang. Perfect lazy day (睡到自然醒) morning in the resort gardens, then stroll to adjacent Shuhe Ancient Town (束河古镇) for coffee — just 10 minutes walk from the resort! The resort's pastoral setting is ideal for this slow wandering day. Check out next morning for Dali drive. Total 3 nights: est. 5400-6600 CNY. Shuhe Old Town coffee stops are a short walk away, perfectly aligned with Day 5 plan.",
          "notes_local": "丽江最后一晚。在度假村花园中睡到自然醒，步行10分钟即可到达束河古镇喝咖啡随缘散步——完美契合第五天计划！第二天早晨退房自驾前往大理。3晚合计预估5400-6600元。束河古镇咖啡馆步行可达，位置完美。",
